WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
Room to rent in a shared flat, in Toulouse, Saint-Cyprien district.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:16.068
We are three students — Inès, 22, Hugo, 24, and Sofia, 21 — and we are looking for a fourth person for the start of the academic year in September.

00:00:16.318 --> 00:00:29.326
The flat is big and bright: four bedrooms, a living room, a fitted kitchen and two bathrooms. The free room is twelve square metres, with a desk and a large wardrobe. The metro is five minutes' walk away.

00:00:29.576 --> 00:00:36.257
The rent is 420 euros a month, bills included: water, electricity and internet.

00:00:36.507 --> 00:00:48.441
At our place, we often cook together and share the housework. Pets are not allowed, because Hugo is allergic to cats. We don't smoke in the flat, but there is a balcony.

00:00:48.691 --> 00:00:54.617
Interested? Send us a message and introduce yourself in a few lines!
